<headroom-library version="1" id="hg-harmonic-minor-lead" category="High Gain" order="30" instrument="guitar" style="Shred">
  <description>Neo-classical shred lead: an overdrive pushing a British 100-watt head with the bass low and the mids and treble high, for a vocal, violin-like tone that keeps fast scalar runs and sweeps clear. A modest echo and hall add size without smearing the notes.</description>
  <tags><tag>High Gain</tag><tag>Shred</tag><tag>Neo-Classical</tag><tag>Lead</tag><tag>Boosted</tag><tag>Delay</tag><tag>Hall</tag></tags>
  <sources>
